UID:castration-movie-year-of-the-hyaena-2026-12-12-15:00:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:Castration Movie is a multi-part postmodern epic by visionary 
 auteur Louise Weard.\n\n⅗ Year of the Hyaena contains part of one chapte
 r. In Chapter iii. Chastity No Exit Virtue Cuck\, Michaela (Louise Weard) 
 tries to be a good person.\n\nLouise Weard\, Canada\, 2026\, ~360 min\, in
  English\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/castration-movie-year-of-the-hya
 ena/\n\nEstimated start: 15:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
