SUMMARY:Go Fish (1994)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T205000
DTSTAMP:20261118T030000Z
UID:go-fish-4k-restoration-2026-11-17-19:00:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:Max (co-writer Guinevere Turner) a young\, lesbian\, college s
 tudent living in Chicago is in aromantic dry spell. Her roommate Kia (T. W
 endy McMillan)\, sets Max up with Ely (V.S. Brodie)\, an older woman that 
 Max initially dismisses but ultimately falls for\, until it’s revealed t
 hat Ely may already be committed.\n\nRose Troche\, 1994\, United States\, 
 88 min\, in English\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/go-fish-4k-restoratio
 n/\n\nEstimated start: 19:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:La Bola Negra
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261123T210000
DTSTAMP:20261124T020000Z
UID:la-bola-negra-2026-11-23-18:00:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:From Cannes-winning directors Javier Calvo and Javier Ambrossi
  — popularly known as Los Javis — La Bola Negra follows three generati
 ons of men across pivotal moments in Spanish history\, bound by pain\, des
 ire\, and love. Carlos (Milo Quifes) longs to belong in a fractured Spain.
  Sebastián (Guitarricadelafuente) finds connection across enemy lines. An
 d Alberto (Carlos González) uncovers a long-buried family secret — one 
 that finally gives voice to truths the past tried to erase.\n\nJavier Ambr
 ossi & Javier Calvo\, Spain\, 2026\, 159 min\, in English and Spanish with
  English subtitles\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/la-bola-negra/\n\nEsti
 mated start: 18:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
