SUMMARY:Unstreamable - Love Streams (1984)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261120T214000
DTSTAMP:20261121T030000Z
UID:unstreamable-love-streams-2026-11-20-19:00:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:Robert is in headlong flight from the stifling love of the lon
 ely women he writes about in his novels. His sister\, Sarah\, has alienate
 d their family with precisely that sort of stultifying love. As the stream
 s of their lives\, loves and dreams intertwine\, these two lost souls begi
 n to find each other and ultimately\, themselves.\n\nJohn Cassavetes\, 198
 4\, United States\, 140 min\, in English\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/
 unstreamable-love-streams/\n\nEstimated start: 19:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
